#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/cdwriteutils/cdrtools.xml:29
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>Cdrtools</application> package contains CD recording "
"utilities. These are useful for reading, creating or writing (burning) CDs, "
"DVDs, and Blu-ray discs."
msgstr ""
"O pacote <application>Cdrtools</application> contém utilitários de gravação "
"de CD. Eles são úteis para ler, criar ou escrever (gravar) CDs, DVDs e "
"discos Blu-ray."

